{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"OESA-2026-3427","published":"2026-08-20T09:57:20Z","modified":"2026-08-20T10:15:11.969276632Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-55995"],"summary":"open-isns security update","details":"The open-isns package consists of the iSNS server and client programs, which is a partial implementation of the iSNS protocol. The iSNS protocol is defined in [RFC 4171](http://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4171) and the purpose of which is to allow it automated and convenient to discover, manage, and configure iSCSI devices.\r\n\r\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nA Double Free vulnerability in open-iscsi allows an unauthenticated MITM attacker to cause DoS.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThis issue affects open-iscsi: from ? through 56718d4e9d1a4f51c30697b5c0534144bb41c9bb.(CVE-2026-55995)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"open-isns","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP3","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/open-isns&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.101-7.oe2403sp3"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["open-isns-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","open-isns-debuginfo-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","open-isns-debugsource-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm","open-isns-devel-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.aarch64.rpm"],"noarch":["open-isns-help-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.noarch.rpm"],"src":["open-isns-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.src.rpm"],"x86_64":["open-isns-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","open-isns-debuginfo-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","open-isns-debugsource-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm","open-isns-devel-0.101-7.oe2403sp3.x86_64.rpm"]},"database_specific":{"source":"https://repo.openeuler.org/security/data/osv/OESA-2026-3427.json"}},{"package":{"name":"open-isns","ecosystem":"openEuler:24.03-LTS-SP4","purl":"pkg:rpm/openEuler/open-isns&distro=openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"0.101-7.oe2403sp4"}]}],"ecosystem_specific":{"aarch64":["open-isns-0.101-7.oe2403sp4.aarch64.rpm","open-isns-debuginfo-0.101-7.oe2403sp4.aarch64.r